  description: '1 "Shaddoll" monster + 1 EARTH monster

    Must first be Fusion
    Summoned. When a Special Summoned monster activates its effect while you have
    a "Shaddoll" card in your hand (Quick Effect): You can negate the activation,
    and if you do, destroy that monster, then send 1 "Shaddoll" card from your hand
    to the GY. You can only use this effect of "El Shaddoll Shekhinaga" once per
    turn. If this card is sent to the GY: You can target 1 "Shaddoll" Spell/Trap
    in your GY; add it to your hand.'
